WEBVTT

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.965
they were stalked, they were raped,

00:02:00.965 --> 00:02:03.506
and no one talked about it.

00:02:03.506 --> 00:02:05.289
There was no justice.

00:02:05.289 --> 00:02:09.913
And as an activist, that was not good enough.

00:02:09.913 --> 00:02:12.384
And so step one on this journey

00:02:12.384 --> 00:02:14.381
is we organized,

00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:17.015
and we created this extraordinary

00:02:17.015 --> 00:02:20.007
underground network of amazing women

00:02:20.007 --> 00:02:21.874
who opened shelters,

00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:23.993
and if they didn't open a shelter,

00:02:23.993 --> 00:02:25.585
they opened their home

00:02:25.585 --> 00:02:28.619
so that women and children could be safe.

00:02:28.619 --> 00:02:30.299
And you know what else we did?